<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>合格証明書</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background: #f5f5f5;
      font-family: "Hiragino Mincho ProN", "Yu Mincho", "Noto Serif JP", serif;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* ===== 追加ヘッダー用 ===== */
    .header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
    }

    .back-btn {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #333;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .app-title {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }

    /* ===== 証明書デザイン ===== */
    .certificate-wrapper {
      width: 794px;
      height: 1123px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 30px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .certificate {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border: 6px double #c9a24d;
      padding: 40px 50px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      position: relative;
    }

    .cert-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .logo {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5b041, #d68910);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    .header-text {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .sub-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .main-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 48px;
      letter-spacing: 12px;
      margin: 20px 0 40px;
    }

    .name {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .info {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 2;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .message {
      width: 80%;
      margin: 0 auto 60px;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 2;
    }

    .footer {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 40px;
      left: 50px;
      right: 50px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
    }

    .org {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .sign-area {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .sign-text {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .seal {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      border: 2px solid #c0392b;
      color: #c0392b;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ===== ここが追加部分 ===== -->
  <header class="header">
    <%= link_to "戻る", carender_path, class: "back-btn" %>
    <h1 class="app-title">証明書ページ</h1>
  </header>
  <!-- ========================= -->

  <div class="certificate-wrapper">
    <div class="certificate">
      <div class="cert-header">
        <div class="logo">PM</div>
        <div class="header-text">Proof Meより勉強したことの証明</div>
      </div>

      <div class="sub-title">今日の勉強時間</div>

      <div class="main-title">勉強証明書</div>

      <div class="name">検定 太郎 殿</div>

      <div class="info">
        認定番号：XXXXXXXX<br />
        認定年月日：20XX年XX月XX日
      </div>

      <div class="message">
        上記の者は、一般社団法人コンピュータ教育振興協会主催の<br />
        20XX年度 2次元CAD利用技術者試験において、<br />
        2級に合格したことを証する。
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <div class="org">
          発行年月日　20XX年XX月XX日<br />
          一般社団法人 コンピュータ教育振興協会<br />
          Association for Computer Skills Promotion
        </div>

        <div class="sign-area">
          <div class="sign-text">代表理事　認定 花子</div>
          <div class="seal">
            協会<br />認定<br />印
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
